Licensing scope

Third-party portions retain their upstream licenses and copyright notices.
See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md, NOTICE, and LICENSES/ for the identified upstream
projects and complete license texts.

No project-wide license grant for the RSC-DETR-specific contributions was
identified in the original project materials. This packaging operation does
not select or grant a new license on behalf of the project authors.

The paper source in docs/paper/ is reference material and is not covered by
the third-party software license copies merely because it is in this package.
